3 CONT his mother →  Vipsania Julia Agrippina 
3 CONT her mother →  Julia Caesaris Major 
3 CONT her mother →  Augustus Caesar, 'Octavian' 
3 CONT her father
2 NOTE Augustus Caesar, 'Octavian' is MY 61st great grandfather.
2 NOTE Augustus Caesar, 'Octavian' is my 52nd great grandfather.
