2 CONT 33740611072440468. Marcus Antonius II "Creticus" Praetor ROMAN EMPIRE,1601,1746 son of Marcus Antonius "the Orator" Consul ROMAN EMPIRE and Unknown, was born in , , Roma, Italy and died in 68 B.C. in , , Roma, Italy. 
