2 CONT
2 CONT ASSARACUS, King at Dardanum, was the son of
2 CONT
2 CONT TROS, King of Troy in 1314 B.C. He married Callirhoe, daughter ofScamander. He built City of Troy and from him the people were calledTrojans. Tros was the son of
2 CONT
2 CONT ERIOTHONIUS, King of Troy in 1374 B.C., married Astyoche. Eriothonius wasthe son of
2 CONT
2 CONT DARDANUS, King of Troy in 1449 B.C., married Basia Asia (see below).Dardanus was the son of
2 CONT
2 CONT JUPITER or CORYTUS who married Electra, daughter of ATLAS.
2 CONT
2 CONT * * *
2 CONT
2 CONT BASIA ASIA (Batea) married Dardanus, King of Troy. Basia Asia was thedaughter of
2 CONT
2 CONT TEUCER, King of Troy in 1480 B.C., was the son of the river
2 CONT
2 CONT SCAMANDER, King of Troy in 1502 B.C., and his wife, the "Nymph Idaea."Scamander was the son of
2 CONT
2 CONT CORYBAS married Demonice.
