2 CONT >"Enlil-nasir I was the king of Assyria from c. 1497 BC to 1485 BC. In the List of Assyrian kings appears the following entry (king # 62): Enlil-nasir, son of Puzur-Ashur (III), ruled for thirteen years.[2] His name is present on 
2 CONC two clay cones from Ashur. He is mentioned in the Synchronistic King list, but the name of the Babylonian counterpart is illegible.[2]"
