0 @N6000000002188286964@ NOTE Marcus Vipsanius Agrippa
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Marcus Vipsanius Agrippa 
1 CONT 63 BC – 12 BC 
1 CONT
1 CONT Marcus Vipsanius Agrippa 
1 CONT Place of birth Unknown 
