1 CONT Antony section in Lives of the Noble Greeks and Romans by Plutarch, of which the English translation is contained in the following Project Gutenberg e-text Plutarch: Lives of the noble Grecians and Romans - Note that parts of Anto
1 CONC ny's story are in Plutarch's life descriptions of Pompey, Caesar, Cicero, Brutus, all of these contained in that same e-text. 
1 CONT In addition to the standard histories, see:
1 CONT
