1 CONT
1 CONT     Aka; Marcus Antonius.
1 CONT     A Roman politician and soldier. While already married, he had a love affair with and then later, reportedly married Cleopatra, Empress of
1 CONT     Egypt, who also committed suicide in 30 BC.
1 CONT     Sources include, but are not limited to;
1 CONT     "Bloodline of the Holy Grail", by Laurence Gardner (1996)
1 CONT     page(s) 409; ISBN
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Father: Marcus Antonius Creticus ROME b: BEF 100
1 CONT Mother: Julia ROME** b: BEF 100
1 CONT
1 CONT Marriage 1 Octavia the Elder ROME b: in 64 B.C.
