1 CONT     * Ptolemy I (at Egyptian Royal Genealogy, with genealogical table)
1 CONT     * Livius, Ptolemy I Soter by Jona Lendering
1 CONT     * A genealogical tree of Ptolemy, though not necessarily reliable
1 CONT     * Ptolemy I Soter’s self-promotion in his history of Alexander the Great
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Alexander IV of Macedon Pharaoh
1 CONT 305 BC – 283 BC Succeeded by:
1 CONT Ptolemy II Philadelphus
1 CONT
